    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d286">

                <pb facs="0461" n="367" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg367"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mendoza to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-09-22"><hi rendition="#italic">September 22,
                            1896</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor herewith to transmit to
                    your excellency, together with the usual office copy, an autograph letter, which
                    the Diet of the Greater Republic of Central America addresses to His Excellency
                    Mr. Cleveland, President of the United States of North America, informing him of
                    the new political organization agreed upon by the Republics of Honduras,
                    Nicaragua, and Salvador.</p>
                <p>Begging your excellency to be pleased to transmit the letter to its high
                    destination, I have the honor to beg you to accept the assurances of my most
                    distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Mendoza.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d286-a1.xml" xpointer="d286-a1"/>
